  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When things get really close to me and everything (like my avatars hand or a sword) they disappear and go invisible, ive gone into setting and my personal space is turned off and it still does it. Id like to be able to see my full body and not just from a far distance id like to be able to look at my avatars pretty nails and such, ird be very nice if u could fix this (srry if i dont make since idk how to explain it)",
